      "before": "- **11.** `packages/core/src/observability/otlp.ts:4d403d30bded809a37d426a8c56361ca8d66ddf7` — configured OTLP startup, lines 7–18,36–76.",
      "after": "- **11.** `packages/core/src/observability/otlp.ts:4d403d30bded809a37d426a8c56361ca8d66ddf7` — configured OTLP startup, lines 7–18,36–76.\n- **12.** `packages/core/src/pty/protocol.ts:cca1266bd0235f21bbac04454824c04b5c839aeb` — conditional first-line removal, lines 44–48.",
